  "scope": "Saved ROI replacement commands accept full regional geometry and retain intrinsic extents, signed origins and opaque attributes. Other regional saved rows, active and Previous selections remain valid source state. Captures use V3 only when original/replacement geometry is regional; V1 ordinary and V2 rounded contracts are preserved. Borrowed admission bounds intrinsic packed samples, metadata in the full record envelope, retained state, controller staging and history before callbacks or pixel reads. Strict replay, explicit rebind, source guards, exact no-op, atomic publication, undo and V4 sessions retain full geometry. Shared ImGui numeric typing and Apply publish the same V3 command without replacing the global selection. Rotation, Boolean operations, regional pointer qualification, axis/planar transforms and ImageJ ROI interchange remain open; this is not complete editor or platform acceptance.",
